  A sequential fast + B peak concurrency == slots  -> Tier A works, use --overlap --exact
  A sequential fast + B peak concurrency == 1   -> job-step exclusivity; check B0 control and flags
  A sequential slow (~1/min)                   -> genuine throttling; Tier A is out, evaluate Flux
  C/D peak < slots or core collisions            -> placement is not enforced at MPI width

